{
  "sourceLanguage": "fr",
  "strings": {
    "**Le décodage** — au plus probable, ou en explorant plusieurs pistes quand la précision prime.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**The decoding** — go with the likeliest word, or explore several paths when accuracy matters most."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Le modèle** — celui que vous venez de choisir. Le plus gros est le plus juste, et le plus lent.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**The model** — the one you just picked. The bigger it is, the more accurate, and the slower."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Le vocabulaire** — quelques phrases d'exemple, et vos noms propres cessent d'être devinés.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**The vocabulary** — a few sample sentences, and your proper nouns stop being guesswork."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "**Les silences** — filtrés, le modèle n'a plus de blanc où inventer du texte.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**The silences** — filtered out, the model has no blank left to invent text in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
